            <ArticleTitle>Male sex and heart disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>When averaged on a daily basis, a man loses more iron in semen than a woman in her menses. This shows that periodical loss of iron in women is unlikely to be the factor protecting against heart disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
